{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X 的 S05 只有18秒，却把多行话和两大块未标“到时出现”的感受词同时摆出，重点容易被挤散；这一段Y的左右分区反而更利于分层扫读。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的分行和【】让叙事锚点更容易被扫到，感受词按乐句出现，又有水面、小船和音乐动作贯穿前后，既能抓住每段重点，也更容易感到整首曲子的情绪连续推进。Y的完整因果句在解释人物动机时更稳，X在S06、S07、S11加入了“要得太多”“忽然一紧”“对方同样需要自己”等心理判断，略有替人物多定一层心理。总体而言，X的音乐同步性、情绪层次和整体连贯性带来的收益更大。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "469bfd8a-dae4-4896-b691-5dd244456812", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T214118896643Z", "elapsed_seconds": 109.203, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T21:43:08.121893+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ea543a0c570934d6eb48220cefab4bedf65536367c2fa5375f17b88cac89be40", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools